No, no, that would be sad.

366
00:24:46,816 --> 00:24:48,816
じゃあ「dahlah」ってどういう意味？
Then, what does "dahlah" mean?

367
00:24:48,816 --> 00:24:51,616
人生はしょうがないって意味
It means "life is what it is / there's no helping it."

368
00:24:51,616 --> 00:24:54,816
人生は重いからまあいいやって言えばいいだけ
Life is heavy, so you just say "whatever".

369
00:24:54,816 --> 00:24:56,816
その後人生を続けようって意味
And then keep moving forward with life.

370
00:24:56,816 --> 00:24:59,816
そうっすね、大人になったらね
That's right, once we grow up.

