00:25:01,487 --> 00:25:07,487
Dan lagu... ya santai, easy listening, jadi kita sambil keliling-keliling kan nyapa fans gitu ya.
Luckily, the song is relaxing and easy listening, so we can walk around and greet the fans, right?

