00:25:07,487 --> 00:25:11,687
Asyik banget ya tadi ya? Aku juga suka banget tadi dansa bagian reff-nya ya.
It was so fun, right? I also really liked the dance during the chorus!

373
00:25:12,087 --> 00:25:17,687
Itu, itu beda lagu gak sih? Gak gitu deh...
Wait, isn't that a different song? I don't think it's like that.

